uch a  commitment most all of our styles start  out as a bather and they work their way  up through our training program over 800  hours  of classroom time with hands-on training  to learn all different types of dogs  breed knowledge and you have to be so  passionate about animals to do what we  do because you take all kinds and we  don't just groom dogs in our salons we  also groom cats and felines what about  bearded dragons because jeremy if you  think i've got dry legs you should meet  jeremy we don't do bearded dragon  grooming yet but maybe in the future  i never know i love that it takes that  long to train  to become a groomer so that the customer  and the owner  feels so safe i mean we've been with  petsmart a long time like this is my  20th year with the company and christy  has been with us 14 years now and she's  also our top 10 member for groom team  usa i am  okay then what do you recommend for  douglas i would recommend our hemp's  package which is a really good shampoo  conditioning treatment you want to add  moisture back into that coat i'd also do  nail grinding which helps keep the nails  really nice and short and smooth so if  he jumps up won't scratch the kids or  you know keeps them nice and short  around the house on hardwood floors  this is a dremel but it has a special  head on it for dogs so it doesn't make  the nail warm or hot it's just the  vibration that feels a little funny well  i would like some of that that's really  nice  so now that we've brushed them out and  done some stuff we have our summer  collection of bandanas here would you  like to pick out something for each of  them it's going to be hard to choose  because i'm so into that  i think i'm gonna go for these two  no shocker here i'm gonna go with the  flowers it's my fave and then i'm  definitely going with the popsicle motif  because these are just sparking a lot of  joy  oh that whole segment i was like look at  that dog look at that dog i just want to  give a huge thank you to ashley and  christy from petsmart for showing me all  the amazing services they offer and if  you want to pamper your furry friends  head over to petsmart.com  to book a grooming or just a walk-in for  a stand-alone service and we want our  studio audience to get in on all the fun  so you're all going home with a hundred  dollar gift card  [Music]

